  "title": "India's Infrastructure and Manufacturing Expansion",
  "summary": "India is allocating ₹11,000 crore for infrastructure equipment manufacturing and boosting domestic production through sales-linked incentives, while also investing in a dedicated CIE testing facility to enhance manufacturing capabilities.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "India is allocating ₹11,000 crore for infrastructure equipment manufacturing in the first phase of the scheme.",
      "confidence": 0.95
